 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "grid is a list of equal-length strings of '*' (object pixel) and '_' (background). The black box is modelled by objectIds, a same-shaped integer grid: objectIds[r][c] >= 1 for an object pixel and 0 for background; isSameObject(p, q) is true when both are object pixels with the same id. Two horizontally or vertically adjacent object pixels are in the same object when isSameObject is true for them. Return the number of objects, i.e. connected groups formed by those links.",
